<#7fc8ff>ICE GAUGE / SHATTER</>
Shatter (ice gauge full)		^X
  Bufula and Artemisia hits chill the opponent and fill the
  ice gauge (bottom of the screen). At full, X on the ground
  becomes Shatter: a rapier thrust that freezes the target
  in place for about a second, then launches. It spends the
  gauge. Also cancels a normal on contact.

<#7fc8ff>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
  Works in the air too.
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
High Jump		_D_U

<#7fc8ff>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium		^A / ^B
Heavy (Artemisia strikes)		^C
Artemisia strike (ground / air)		^X
  X is Shatter instead while the ice gauge is full.
Crouching Light / Medium		_D^A / _D^B
Crouching Heavy		_D^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
  Normals chain on contact: Light into Medium into Heavy,
  standing into crouching and back. Every normal cancels
  into a special. Crouching Heavy, Getsu-Ei and EX Coup Droit
  are launchers: only one of them per combo.

<#7fc8ff>SPECIALS</>
Coup Droit		_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Marin Karin		_D_DB_B^A
Tentarafoo		_D_DB_B^B
Getsu-Ei (air OK)		_F_D_DF^B

<#7fc8ff>EX (500 meter)</>
EX Coup Droit		_D_DF_F^C
Bufula		_D_DB_B^C

<#7fc8ff>SUPERS</>
Myriad Arrows (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Bufudyne (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  Either works with A+B or B+C.
Niflheim (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  Cinematic grab for a flat 350 damage, no instant kill.
